OL,3,GNEWSANewly discovered dinosaur named
OL,4,Aafter Surrey dad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new species and genus of dinosaur has
OL,7,Fbeen named after a Surrey dad.
OL,9,FPaludohadros proudlovii - an
OL,10,Figuanodontian - was named in honour of
OL,11,Fthe late Will Proudlove, who managed
OL,12,Fthe Ewhurst brick and roof tile works
OL,13,Fwhere the dinosaur was discovered.
OL,15,FProudlove passed away at the age of 35,
OL,16,Fshortly before the dinosaur's fossil
OL,17,Fwas found in 2001 and donated to the
OL,18,FNatural History Museum.
OL,20,FHis wife Rachel told BBC Radio Surrey
OL,21,Fthere was a history of finding dinosaur
OL,22,Fremains where the father-of-two worked.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
